<title>USA: Pilgrim's Pride registers offering.</title>
<headline>Pilgrim's Pride registers offering.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURG, Texas 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pilgrim's Pride Corp said on Friday that it has filed a registration statement for the public offering of 6,261,382 shares of common stock, including 5,514,900 shares to be sold by Archer Daniels Midland Co.</p>
<p>In addition, Pilgrim Pride, a chicken producer, said it intends to grant the underwriters an overallotment option, although it did not specify the number of shares.</p>
</text>
